{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"dbc00ad5c9385b43","x":-260,"y":-80,"width":625,"height":210,"type":"text","text":"• The Articles of the Anchor: The strict tone comes from their code. There are no city guards, only the \"Brethren's Law.\" Stealing from a fellow crew on the island, murdering without a formal challenge, or drawing a blade in neutral ground means immediate, brutal execution by the Pirate Lord's enforcers.\n• The Culture: When not settling grudges, it is a non-stop festival. Fiddles play through the night, barrels of rum are tapped openly in the streets, and crews spend their plunder as fast as they steal it.\n"},
		{"id":"6b13504505ad8a1d","x":-440,"y":-315,"width":209,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Lundra Ocean.canvas]]\n#Volstarian_Dynasty "}
